RemoveYoVault_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller not authorized
│  └── it should revert with Unauthorized
├── when vault address is zero
│  └── it should revert with Registry__VaultAddressZero
├── when authorized caller removes a registered vault
│  ├── it should unregister the vault
│  └── it should emit YoVaultRemoved(asset, vault)
└── when removing a vault that was never registered
   └── it should revert with Registry__VaultNotExists
